    "body": "- in the wireframe the label is License, although we have many items with a rights statement rather than a license (e.g., https://era-beta.library.ualberta.ca/items/fe483322-d61c-4a74-84f4-9f2ca658c362). question for @leahvanderjagt and @sfbetz should the label be License when dcterms:license and Rights when dc:rights?\r\n- date created seems to be pulling data from sort year rather than dcterms:created (e.g. https://era-beta.library.ualberta.ca/items/20a5f95c-c18c-43f4-9baf-bbb9cd020050)\r\n- for theses, committee members don't seem to be displaying (e.g., https://era-beta.library.ualberta.ca/items/71afd4bf-1acb-443d-a910-435ae2a0f06e)\r\n- when clicking on a linked metadata element, such as Type of Item Thesis in the example above (https://era-beta.library.ualberta.ca/items/71afd4bf-1acb-443d-a910-435ae2a0f06e), the Items tab seems to show the correct number of items, but the Collections and Communities tabs seem to always show the total number; just wondering if that's what's desired?",
